This Update of libcrypto and libssl is because of vulnerability updates recommended from opessl forum to update to openssl_1.1.1s version where they were fixed. So as part that update openssl bin and libcrypto.so.1.1 and libssl.so.1.1 is being copied to device and getting updated

This RAR task will copy updated libcrypto.so and libssl.so libraries from latest nd_Core_utils branch to /nd_lib/ and /usr/lib/ path for both 32 and 64 bit.

Also linking this libcrypto.so to libcrypto.so.1.1 and libssl.so to libssl.so.1.1 in this Task.
          
